{"id":"condicio_n","lemma":"condición","pos":"noun","rank":1408,"glosses":["condition","possibility; the makings"],"ipa":"/kondiˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"condiciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-condici%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Sólo pongo una condición.","en":"I only have one condition.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586887"},{"text":"Quieren mejorar sus condiciones laborales.","en":"They want to better their working conditions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692366"},{"text":"Él está en buena condición física.","en":"He is in good physical condition.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/788408"},{"text":"Tom está en bastantes malas condiciones.","en":"Tom is pretty beat up.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803567"},{"text":"Lo haré, pero con una condición.","en":"I'll do it, but there's one condition.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689055"}]}